          "text": "ngo Kuko watsinzwe mu mutima wawe, ukicisha bugufi imbere yiwe, igihe wumva ivyo yavuze kur’ aha hantu bo n’abahaba, ingene hazocika imisaka n’ikivume, ukitantamurirakw impuzu zawe, ukaririra imbere yiwe, ngo Na we arakwumvise; ni k’Uhoraho agize. ",
